<title>USA: Lookout Mountain, Tenn. won by Pioneer. [CORRECTED 20:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Lookout Mountain, Tenn. won by Pioneer. [CORRECTED 20:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to show that Pioneer Bank won the bonds, not A.G. Edwards. Also supplies Pioneer's true interest cost and scale.)</p>
<p>Pioneer Bank said Tuesday it won $1.8 million Lookout Mountain, Tenn., general obligation school bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.9993 percent.</p>
</text>
